      "text": "one Shepherd over all earth, 1 Ne. 13:41. there shall be one fold and one shepherd, 1 Ne. 22:25 (3 Ne. 15:17; 16:3; John 10:16). men are as wild flock that fleeth from shepherd, Mosiah 8:21. wicked have gone astray, as sheep having no shepherd, Alma 5:37. if men are not sheep of Good Shepherd, devil is their shepherd, Alma 5:39. priests of Noah3 to be scattered and slain as sheep without shepherd, Alma 25:12. Lamanites to be brought to knowledge of True Shepherd, Hel. 15:13. Nephites once had Christ for their shepherd, Morm. 5:17.",
